{"title":"3 ft Tabletop Christmas Trees","description":"\u003ch3\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e Artificial Tabletop Christmas Trees for Small Spaces and Holiday Accents\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h3\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eShop tabletop artificial Christmas trees from King of Christmas to bring festive charm to smaller spaces throughout your home. Crafted with the same attention to detail as our full-sized trees, these compact trees feature realistic foliage, full silhouettes, and high-quality construction for a polished holiday look.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003ePerfect for apartments, offices, bedrooms, and entryways, tabletop trees make it easy to decorate areas that can’t accommodate a traditional tree. Whether styled on a dining table, mantel, or sideboard, they offer a simple way to extend your holiday décor into every corner of your space.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eExplore our collection of tabletop Christmas trees to find the perfect size and style for your home this season.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eWhat is a tabletop Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eA tabletop Christmas tree is a compact artificial tree, typically around 3 feet tall, designed to be displayed on surfaces such as tablescapes, mantels, or on the floor beside your fireplace. While more compact in size, these trees are used to deliver the same realistic look and quality as a \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca title=\"Artificial Christmas Trees\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/artificial-christmas-trees\"\u003efull-sized Christmas tree\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eThey are well-suited for adding festive décor to smaller spaces or for complementing your main Christmas tree.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003ch4 dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eHow do you decorate a tabletop Christmas tree?\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/h4\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eDecorating a tabletop Christmas tree can be as simple or detailed as you prefer. Many people choose to coordinate their tabletop tree with their full-sized tree using similar King of Christmas \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca title=\"Christmas Ornaments\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/christmas-ornaments\"\u003eornaments\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, \u003cstrong\u003e\u003ca title=\"Christmas Ribbon\" href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/ribbons\"\u003eribbon\u003c\/a\u003e\u003c\/strong\u003e, or decorative picks for a cohesive look on a smaller scale. \u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eYou can also create a unique display by using a specific theme, color palette, or style. Pre-lit tabletop trees offer added convenience and provide a warm, inviting glow without the need for additional lights.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"ltr\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(77, 93, 69);\"\u003eComplete your holiday décor with tabletop Christmas trees from King of Christmas, designed to bring festive detail and realistic beauty to any space. Whether used as a standalone accent or paired with a full-sized tree, these compact designs make it easy to create a cohesive and elevated holiday look throughout your home.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e \u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"3-foot-king-flock-tree-unlit","title":"3' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tabletop Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eJust admit it, we all know why you're here. You might have seen it at a friend's place, or perhaps your cousin won't quit it with how stunning theirs looks, or maybe you're checking in to see if all that Instagram hype is real. Well, without further ado, we present the 3' King Flock mini tree. With a natural-colored burlap base, the 3' King Flock tree is a scaled-down version of the king flock without compromising on the quality or details of the tree. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe King Flock Christmas tree is one of our premier signature trees. It features state of the art design with a blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) resulting in a grand and beautiful hallmark Christmas tree. With heavily flocked tips, you can enjoy the look of freshly fallen snow adorning each branch of your tree. So let it snow this holiday season while you sip eggnog, and marvel at this wonderland masterpiece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642907258944,"sku":"KF-T3-U","price":59.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFlock-2-2_170a15ef-d464-454d-9625-ca3ff991681f.jpg?v=1714673849"},{"product_id":"3-foot-king-flock-tree-led","title":"3' King Flock® Artificial Christmas Tabletop Tree with 50 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eJust admit it, we all know why you're here. You might have seen it at a friend's place, or perhaps your cousin won't quit it with how stunning theirs looks, or maybe you're checking in to see if all that Instagram hype is real. Well, without further ado, we present the 3' King Flock mini tree. With a natural-colored burlap base, the 3' King Flock tree is a scaled-down version of the king flock without compromising on the quality or details of the tree. \u003c\/p\u003e\n\n\u003cp\u003eThe King Flock Christmas tree is one of our premier signature trees. It features state of the art design with a blend of realistic tips (PE) and classic tips (PVC) resulting in a grand and beautiful hallmark Christmas tree. With heavily flocked tips, you can enjoy the look of freshly fallen snow adorning each branch of your tree. So let it snow this holiday season while you sip eggnog, and marvel at this wonderland masterpiece.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":28642907979840,"sku":"KF-T3-L","price":74.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021KingFlock-2-2_ac68b0d3-ee5d-45d8-a708-8a5b98f62f20.jpg?v=1714673856"},{"product_id":"3-foot-royal-fir-unlit","title":"3' Royal Fir Tabletop Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhy settle for less this holiday season when you can celebrate in grand style. Add a breathtaking Christmas tree to your home decor when you choose the Royal Fir to grace your home this holiday season. This stunning and magnificent Christmas tree is full-bodied and features realistic foliage that creates a beautiful and lifelike display. The Royal Fir is one of our hallmark signature trees and features a high-end design for the ultimate Christmas tree display. The 3' Royal Fir is a miniature version of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/royal-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Fir Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e. Using the same tips and structure to give the tree a full-bodied and realistic look. The base is made of porcelain and resembles a wooden tree stump. Round out your Christmas collection this holiday season with the 3' Royal Fir tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":29445093883968,"sku":"RF-T3-U","price":89.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021RoyalFir-3-2.jpg?v=1718158123"},{"product_id":"3-foot-queen-flock-tree-unlit","title":"3' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tabletop Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eNo Christmas setting is complete without at least one tabletop tree! A scaled down version of our signature flock collection, the small but mighty Queen Flock mini Christmas tree sits perfectly on any tabletop, fireplace hearth, or anywhere else that needs a “little” Christmas spirit. 3 feet tall and 18” wide, this portable beauty can easily be moved around anywhere for quick and easy redecorating. Plus, with a blend of realistic and classic needle tips combined with handmade heavily flocked branches, you and your loved ones will get to enjoy the magical feeling of freshly fallen snow in the warmth of your own home\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284858908872,"sku":"QF-T3-U","price":49.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021QueenFlock-2-2_a4936b8b-b425-4e84-bc55-9ba70b26462d.jpg?v=1714674019"},{"product_id":"3-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"3' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tabletop Tree with 50 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eNo Christmas setting is complete without at least one tabletop tree! A scaled down version of our signature flock collection, the small but mighty Queen Flock mini Christmas tree sits perfectly on any tabletop, fireplace hearth, or anywhere else that needs a “little” Christmas spirit. 3 feet tall and 18” wide, this portable beauty can easily be moved around anywhere for quick and easy redecorating. Plus, with a blend of realistic and classic needle tips combined with handmade heavily flocked branches, you and your loved ones will get to enjoy the magical feeling of freshly fallen snow in the warmth of your own home. For added convenience, this elegant garland has been expertly pre-strung with 50 warm white LED lights, which are battery operated for a clean and seamless accent that won’t use up your outlets and can be placed virtually anywhere!\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":40284858974408,"sku":"QF-T3-L","price":79.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":false}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KOC2021QueenFlock-2-2_7ecaac68-888e-40ee-9680-7f62ac4c4e1b.jpg?v=1714674017"},{"product_id":"3-foot-king-noble-fir-led","title":"3' King Noble Fir Tabletop Tree with 70 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhen you need one elegant solution that offers the perfect upgrade for your holiday décor this season, look no further than the King Noble Tabletop Tree\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42314111680712,"sku":"KNF-T3-L-Bat","price":99.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/products\/KingNobleTabletop.jpg?v=1714673641"},{"product_id":"3-foot-royal-fir-led","title":"3' Royal Fir Tabletop Tree with 100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eWhy settle for less this holiday season when you can celebrate in grand style. Add a breathtaking Christmas tree to your home decor when you choose the Royal Fir to grace your home this holiday season. This stunning and magnificent Christmas tree is full-bodied and features realistic foliage that creates a beautiful and lifelike display. The Royal Fir is one of our hallmark signature trees and features a high-end design for the ultimate Christmas tree display. The 3' Royal Fir is a miniature version of our \u003ca href=\"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/royal-fir-artificial-christmas-tree\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"\u003e\u003cspan style=\"color: #339966;\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eRoyal Fir Tree\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/span\u003e\u003c\/a\u003e. Using the same tips and structure to give the tree a full-bodied and realistic look. The base is made of porcelain and resembles a wooden tree stump. Round out your Christmas collection this holiday season with the 3' Royal Fir tree.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":42852912627912,"sku":"3F-RF-ST-L","price":119.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KOC2021RoyalFir-3-2_17a0b735-0403-4b0c-a7b7-36501dad0817.jpg?v=1718158120"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/collections\/KOC2021KingFlock-2-2_ac68b0d3-ee5d-45d8-a708-8a5b98f62f20.jpg?v=1750877826","url":"https:\/\/www.kingofchristmas.com\/collections\/3-foot-artificial-christmas-trees.oembed","provider":"King of Christmas","version":"1.0","type":"link"}